          "id": "Av2ehn3RdLrlzohO",
          "name": "Supabase Postgres"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Rolling 3-month window: deletes old slack vector rows, slack_threads rows, ingest_ledger rows, and orphaned slack_thread resource nodes. Runs every execution (fans off Channels, executeOnce)."
    },
